Kronos modifications copyright (c) 2024-2026 SpaceJamp
Modifications include:
- Linux CLI support (net10.0 target)
- Cross-platform core libraries (Storage, Database, Updater, WinTrust, Logger, etc.)
- Auto-updater with GitHub Releases integration and SHA256 verification
- Linux build scripts (build.sh) and Windows cross-compile script (build.ps1)
- GitHub Actions workflow for multi-platform releases
- Platform abstractions for XDG paths, credentials, proxy settings
- Multi-target csproj: net10.0 (Linux) + net10.0-windows10.0.26100.0 (Windows)
- Removed Inno Setup installer scripts
- Removed the Avalonia GUI project, which was unfinished and could overwrite the
  real settings.json with an incompatible schema

